# .NET conventions

- Use existing patterns: MediatR handlers, FluentValidation, EF Core migrations.
- Health endpoints: `/health` and `/alive` where present.
- Problem details include `traceId` in exception middleware — preserve format.
- DI registration in `DependencyInjection.cs` or `Program.cs` per service style.
- No new packages unless SPEC or user requires them.
